  <item>
    <title>Vol.6 💭漫谈：毛振华 | 何以“明清苏州文人园林”？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680fb7df7a449ae85842f143</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">680fb7df7a449ae85842f143</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 28 Apr 2025 18:58:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>城市不知道 | 系列三：明清苏州文人园林@清谈城市</span></p><span></span><p><span>------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>主题：清谈城市之苏州园林如何形成今日的面貌</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：毛振华 &nbsp;苏州望族富潘后人，祖上曾是历代拙政园主人之一，行走的苏州文化百科全书</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持：郑言</span></p><span></span><p><span>------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>你遗忘的、我难忘的，城市都记得。大家好，我叫郑言。欢迎收听“城市不知道”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这里，我会实地暴走、认真考据，和大家一起深挖城市的前世今生、古迹新貌。在大家抵达现场去探索城市的时候，尽可能做一个有干货、不无聊的向导，一起为当下的生活样貌寻找来处。</span></p><span></span><p><span>------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>一直想梳理梳理苏州文人园林形成今日之局面的脉络，今天终于有机会和毛老师坐一来聊聊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>聊天嘛，就是随意地枝蔓出去，但大致不离开主线</span></p><span></span><p><span>-----------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="67">00:01:07</a> &nbsp;园林都有什么类别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="333">00:05:33</a> &nbsp;苏州文人园林形成的契机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="638">00:10:38</a> &nbsp;苏州园林何以在江南脱颖而出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="912">00:15:12</a> &nbsp;狭义的江南是哪里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1127">00:18:47</a> &nbsp;苏州的地理和历史地位</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1213">00:20:13</a> &nbsp;文人园林成熟期是宋朝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1375">00:22:55</a> &nbsp;文人为何造园</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1681">00:28:01</a> &nbsp;江南的最佳推手竟是他</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1810">00:30:10</a> &nbsp;沧浪亭是苏州园林的精神圣地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2052">00:34:12</a> &nbsp;何为长物？园林不是必需品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2570">00:42:50</a> &nbsp;盛世的园林、乱世的山水画</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2961">00:49:21</a> &nbsp;文人园林如何形成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3224">00:53:44</a> &nbsp;单就造园来说，苏州的天赋如何</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3588">00:59:48</a> &nbsp;文人园林如何形成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3735">01:02:15</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;对园林的感受需要一个契机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3872">01:04:32</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;谈苏州文人和苏州园林，绕不开文徵明</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4486">01:14:46</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;那些有争议的人物：宋徽宗、赵孟頫、梁清标</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4703">01:18:23</a> “元四家”和“明四家”为何都出自江南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4877">01:21:17</a> &nbsp;宋代的文化活动因何繁荣，又如何影响后代</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5088">01:24:48</a> &nbsp;元代苏州如何造园</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5294">01:28:14</a> &nbsp;明代有一个大bug，造园高峰但文化活动逐渐转向隐秘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5939">01:38:59</a> &nbsp;让苏州人选，朱元璋？还是张士诚？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6228">01:43:48</a> &nbsp;清朝，具体到清晚期又是一个造园的高峰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7071">01:57:51</a> &nbsp;文脉在原有的园址上延续</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7162">01:59:22</a> &nbsp;作为景点的园林应该如何打开</span></p><span></span><p><span>配乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>----------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>需要苏州、上海两地博物馆、园林、文化特展导览请添加微信：17751231943预约。</span></p><span></span><p><span>------------</span></p>]]></description>
