    <title>Vol.1 🎧️导览 | 苏州拙政园1小时基础导览</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66953f1e37236c546e5a0d72</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66953f1e37236c546e5a0d72</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 15 Jul 2024 15:24:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>城市不知道 | 系列一：拙政园导览@城市晃荡指南</span></p><span></span><p><span>拙政园：低头有“一池的天人合一”，抬头有“一塔的千年注目”</span></p><span></span><p><span>------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>主题：苏州拙政园1小时基础导览</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：郑言</span></p><span></span><p><span>----------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>你遗忘的、我难忘的，城市都记得。大家好，我叫郑言。欢迎收听“城市不知道”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这里，我会实地暴走、认真考据，和大家一起深挖城市的前世今生、古迹新貌。在大家抵达现场去探索城市的时候，尽可能做一个有干货、不无聊的向导，一起为当下的生活样貌寻找来处。</span></p><span></span><p><span>------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>背景音乐：《城市中的陌生人》by 鲸鱼马戏团</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> &nbsp;播客录制的初心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> &nbsp;拙政园文化地位的官方背书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a> &nbsp;拙政园作为私家园林的历史变迁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1815">30:15</a> &nbsp;中国古典园林如何形成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2650">44:10</a> &nbsp;看懂拙政园的题眼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3090">51:30</a> &nbsp;拙政园里“伟大的借景”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3315">55:15</a> &nbsp;拙政园和山水画的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3510">58:30</a> &nbsp;拙政园的建筑如何建筑空间和时间的关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3880">01:04:40</a> &nbsp;中国古典园林造园的精神动力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4230">01:10:30</a> &nbsp;彩蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>拙政园平面图：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs1HSnnLyto1tnwUrjpxQ4ubeKE6.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>苑字篆书：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnb3KgGWqyCAq3_5DmT-6nXodH5Y.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>囿字篆书：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnMz1hY5muy2w9NNdEb2aD1p5_y0.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>仙字演变：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh-8QEGvQRJU-oprPhNJNN3ndBar.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtEKIexG6g5SuMgBbUQs5y0aWJKa.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>园、林字篆书：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo5zW49pWZQ1w5aI7OkPry2sU-Bw.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtpzXbrZ0fnphNnUJD-7Pe8jayYn.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>附拙政园详细游览攻略和路线</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>🎫门票：淡季70，旺季80</span></p><span></span><p><span>⌚7点30～17点30（17点后停止入园）</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚗旁边有几个停车场，狮子林停车场最近，但外地号牌限行时段是7点-9点，16点半—18点半，限行时段抵达，可以停到人民路以西的停车场，步行前往。地铁6号线临顿路站1号口出，步行导航可到。</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>淡旺季皆可使用的经典路线：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span>21个拍照机位，完整走完或看到拙政园所有景点</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>东部花园正门入→东出口出</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>东部：</span></strong><span>兰雪堂→涵青亭→（📷 经过折桥远眺芙蓉榭）→芙蓉榭→天泉亭→（🚾东北角洗手间）→秫香馆→（📷框景北寺塔）→</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>中部：</span></strong><span>倚虹亭→梧竹幽居亭→（📷远看待霜亭）→（📷借景北寺塔经典机位）→（📷远看雪香云蔚亭）→远香堂（朝北）→（🚶穿过远香堂）→远香堂（朝南）→（📷远香堂南边台子回望雪香云蔚亭）→ （📷枇杷园门口框景）→绣绮亭→（📷俯瞰枇杷园园内）→（📷绣绮亭晓丹晚翠框景）→ 海棠春坞→（🚶经长廊进入听雨轩院落）→（📷 看玲珑馆后面花窗+芭蕉）→听雨轩→（📷雨打芭蕉框景）→嘉实亭→（📷嘉实亭框景）→ （🚾南出口洗手间）→（📷晚翠框景）→玲珑馆→（📷玲珑馆芭蕉漏景）→ （🚶返回远香堂南边台子过梁桥）→小沧浪→（📷隔小飞虹廊桥拍远景）→得真亭→小飞虹→（🚶经过倚玉轩门口五福临门花街铺地）→（🚶经过曲桥远眺香洲）→荷风四面亭→（🚶📷 经过拙政园最精彩的一段曲桥远眺香洲和见山楼）→柳阴路曲→</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>西部：</span></strong><span>别有洞天→（📷右侧水廊第二根柱子拍笠亭+与谁同坐轩叠景）→卅六鸳鸯馆→（📷晴天卅六鸳鸯馆追玻璃花窗）→塔影亭→留听阁→与谁同坐轩→（📷拍苏州园林三大长廊之拙政园水廊）→（📷拍倒影楼）→拜文揖沈之斋→</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>中部：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>见山楼→（📷见山楼附近各种经典机位）→（🚾北墙根洗手间（AAA洗手间，有化妆间、冬天有热水））→（📷待霜亭后各种经典机位）→绿漪亭→ 文创店1（可以卖到玻璃花窗文创、雪糕等）→文创店2（可以盖章、买水、吃的）→ （🚶路过一排茅草屋）→东出口</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果赶着去苏博本馆，可以在附近吃</span></p><span></span><p><span>孙盛兴奥灶面（拙政园店），美食网站上有套餐可买，爆鱼面和米饭套餐都好吃</span></p><span></span><p><span>苏漾糖水铺·苏式甜品，各种好吃，按自己的口味点。</span></p><span></span><p><span>------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>拙政园中部花园俯瞰：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FifAaJVg4OaStncHe1pGPsTNYCAM.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>拙政园中部花园俯瞰：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkSzazpK16AXXKbnTip1LK9GoEWx.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>拙政园西部花园俯瞰：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp1_FUtWhyGNcSB-IZhWVzbkw_Dy.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>拙政园借景北寺塔：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/losdkQUygSQSLBbLurUk1zx7Q9q0.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>拙政园和北寺塔：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiF1NyvMEVHRXHsWB_mX8PnI1c-b.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>卅六鸳鸯馆：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoJ1CoSZ4VjwFRRdsTNLZ33yBpL4.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lk-3GWthRyPQ-_4hhIjw3DmwkzX1.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhKgrtnM-EipXuc4PxyXgAY6v2i0.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>拙政园夏日荷花：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lna2r-084kKFGuuhnoQl_pUzKCHQ.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>拙政园夏日观鸟：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FigvSEaG8nw8oYvV7UA38YQ3cfy4.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>拙政园枇杷园框景：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flv2rJqAl1CLDGhsS_kLOMVC0WHK.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><strong><span>拙政园梧竹幽居亭框景：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkzrBOes3L8ZUJV_mI004cfNHP08.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>相关阅读：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《中国古代物质文化丛书：园冶》 &nbsp;计成/倪泰一 &nbsp;著</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《中国古建筑之旅：苏州古典园林》 宫灵娟 &nbsp;著</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《园林有境》 陈从周 &nbsp;著</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>《长物志》 文震亨 &nbsp;著</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>《东南园墅》 童雋 &nbsp;著/童明 译</span></p><span></span><p><span>------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>需要苏州、上海两地博物馆、园林、文化特展导览请添加微信：17751231943预约。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmt0KW_4mn3lELbnj7hswej_iKLb.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>-----------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>游玩攻略：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/-VxpXuyH6gLP53gq3Mpmjg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/-VxpXuyH6gLP53gq3Mpmjg"><span>【攻略】苏州这个地铁口，出来全是好风景</span></a></p>]]></description>
